WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.030
This is my first rodent.

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.350
What does it taste like to you?

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.150
Tastes like chicken.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.850
[LAUGHS]

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.850
Everything that the
American cuisine is today

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.160
is because all these different
people and different cultures

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.585
contributed to it.
Mm.

00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:16.395
Mm.

00:00:16.395 --> 00:00:17.195
Mm.

00:00:17.195 --> 00:00:18.120
Oh, my god.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.440
It's such a flavor explosion.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.740
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.760
Everybody knows Thai food.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.190
Nobody knows about Thai people.

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.940
There's the dish, and then
there's the hands that

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.890
prepare and serve the dish.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.366
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.046
This alone is reason
to come to El Paso.

00:00:40.046 --> 00:00:41.462
Mm.

00:00:41.462 --> 00:00:42.380
Ah.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.180
That's good, huh?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.450
[LAUGHS]

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.464
Burp a little.

00:00:45.464 --> 00:00:47.200
[LAUGHS]

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.280
Le Thai 2.0, dude.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.570
Padma Thai?

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.990
Watch your back.
God damn it.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:52.790
[LAUGHS]

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:53.780
Food is medicine.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.400
We've all heard that before.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.290
It's much deeper than
just what feeds you.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:01.260
It's like a
spiritual connection.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.069
The gateway to
another culture often

00:01:05.069 --> 00:01:07.430
happens first through food.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.480
OK, Inshallah, as they say.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.740
Inshallah.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.200
If you sit at my table and eat
with me, you'll know who I am.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.170
This is what American
food looks like.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.090
This is the original.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:22.580
This is real America.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:23.840
I'm really sorry
you can't eat this.

00:01:26.546 --> 00:01:30.200
[PANTING] I always
[BLEEP] do that.

